I see.

00:16:56.180 --> 00:17:00.410
That might be why we made such a bond.

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:04.120
You must know but...

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:08.440
...we demons and gods are eternal existences, thus...

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.650
...we may not produce anything.

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:12.460
Oh, yes...

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:16.340
Consequently, we have no conceptualization of sisters nor family.

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:20.270
Then she is...

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:24.690
Yes...different from what a human sister would be.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:30.320
Finea was like that in the demon realm.

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:36.420
While I kept protecting her because she was the same magic-beast like me,

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:38.420
she became attached to me and she admired me.

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:44.540
Before we even realized it, we were acting like real sisters would.

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:55.670
There were times when I was being thrown around or was troubled because of her actions.

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:02.520
But maybe I myself might have been wishing too,

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:09.350
For a warm family that you speak of, that doesn't exist between demons.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.190
Eine-san...

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:17.500
Thank you so much, Takuto-san.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:25.600
Now, I have no regrets about returning to the demon realm.

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:34.500
What do you mean "returning"?

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:36.300
Eine-san...

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:42.170
Since I can't send Finea back to the demon realm on her own.

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:46.220
No, but why suddenly...

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:48.880
Since she is my precious family.

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:52.650
I have to respond to her feelings of admiration of me.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:58.030
But it is too sudden!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.320
I don't want that!

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:02.330
Wait, please...

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:04.120
Eine-san.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.290
This is wrong!

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:10.000
Because,

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:11.640
Eine-san...

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:12.500
Eine-san!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:20.580
Goodbye, Takuto-san...

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.810
Eine-san!

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:40.860
Eine-san...

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:47.130
And so, Eine-san disappeared from my sight...

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:55.500
Geez...

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:58.080
Just three days and things turn out like this?

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:00.600
This is what I get for leaving everything to her.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:06.050
Since Eine-san was enthusiastic with work.

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:09.350
You... were thinking of Eine as...

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:12.970
It's not like that!

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:16.880
Eine-san was strong as well as gentle.

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:18.530
She possessed...

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:20.840
A gentleness like a mother's.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:22.880
How cruel, calling me "a mother".

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:24.700
Yes, isn't it?

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.200
I can't call you a mothe-

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:29.120
Wha-

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:31.640
D-D-Didn't you return to the demon realm?

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:33.470
Eine-san?

00:20:33.470 --> 00:20:37.880
Yes, I returned once to send Finea back.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:41.600
So then, accepting her feelings as a family?

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:44.640
Yes I re-educated her.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:47.180
Now she won't randomly come to this side.

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:49.610
Since she is my precious family,

00:20:49.610 --> 00:20:52.350
I have to be strict and set things straight.

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:56.080
You are right.

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:58.590
She has without a doubt the attraction of a 'mother-type',

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:00.520
and the "mother who's obsessed with teaching'.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:02.240
Last time...

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:03.820
Who is...

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:07.620
Who is the "mother who's obsessed with teaching'?

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.060
Listen...

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:13.250
I have no intent on commenting on my Master's hobby.

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:16.740
But when you don't have enough time to watch or play them,

00:21:16.740 --> 00:21:21.620
I am telling you that you should refrain from buying more DVDs and games.

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:23.510
You keep stocking them even if you buy them.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:24.420
Sorry...

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:28.760
It's like, not placing your chopsticks on food that had been served.

00:21:29.340 --> 00:21:33.060
It can be considered rude to the people who made them-

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:40.530
Welcome back, Eine-san!

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:47.530
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, Onee-sama!

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:49.380
I will be a good girl.

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:51.760
I won't say any more selfish things.

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:54.960
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry...

